の自宅寝室/夜\n\n○構図\n※ はたては上下下着姿で、彼氏もパンツだけ履いた状態\n①布団の上で仰向けになるはたての上半身を映してください\n②ブラジャーを外して捲り上げた状態\n\n○差分\n①下着を外され乳房を見られ恥ずかしがるはたて\n②恐る恐る胸を触る彼氏\n③彼氏も控えめにさわってるだけなので、勇気を出して「もう少し激しくしていいから…」と伝えるはたて\n④スイッチが入ったのか、乳首を吸い始める\n⑤胸を揉まれながら乳首を吸われて激しく感じるはたて\n⑥吸うのをやめ、パンツに手を突っ込む彼氏", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Tutihumaz77/works/639", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d3c8693/uploads/origins/c53af0fd-4b8b-4239-aad1-b8a853c523c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a4495d1a53c8b9575f05d00cf57a8181", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d3c8693/uploads/origins/c53af0fd-4b8b-4239-aad1-b8a853c523c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a4495d1a53c8b9575f05d00cf57a8181, https://si.imgix.net/6d3c8693/uploads/origins/c53af0fd-4b8b-4239-aad1-b8a853c523c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cbf5e9211d9e3f8a002f4dedb4f22f9c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d3c8693/uploads/origins/c53af0fd-4b8b-4239-aad1-b8a853c523c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fb1f818d5a8a95b592f2959ed632f199 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Tutihumaz77/works/638", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/af7e1d92/uploads/origins/87096649-d912-496d-936f-3985df532664?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8603eede0c6d0d067fb101ef2a336a3f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/af7e1d92/uploads/origins/87096649-d912-496d-936f-3985df532664?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=